%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%Title: tutw1.2.ps
%%Creator: Xcircuit v2.0
%%CreationDate: Fri Apr 14 16:35:19 2000
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 68 68 331 211
%%DocumentNeededResources: font Times-Roman 
